# 统一换行符，避免 Windows / Linux 协作时出现整文件差异
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换与 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.zip binary

# 语言统计
*.md linguist-documentation
CHANGELOG.md linguist-documentation
LICENSE linguist-documentation
